Sokha's family members have different jobs. His mother is a receptionist in a hotel. His father is a manager in a bank. His uncle is a taxi driver, and his aunt is a factory worker. His cousin is a salesperson in a phone shop. His brother is a delivery rider. Their neighbour is a security guard, and her husband is an office worker.

